Data And Online Services
------------------------

The native and Mini Program SDK archives contain no terrain repository,
satellite imagery, Tianditu credential, or persistent Tianditu cache. Checked-in
binary terrain records are regression fixtures and are not included in SDK
archives. The browser evidence texture is generated locally from synthetic
colors; it is not redistributed imagery.

Tianditu is an optional application-configured online provider. Applications
must supply an authorized credential, display the required attribution, and
review the provider's current terms, request-domain rules, and cache policy.

Generated Artifacts
-------------------

Native archives are generated from the CMake `TerraSdk` install component.
Mini Program archives contain the C ABI header, Wasm module, JavaScript runtime
adapters, documentation, and these notices. Release manifests record the SDK
version, C ABI version, byte size, and SHA-256 checksums.

This notice summarizes repository provenance and is not legal advice. Review
`LICENSE`, `spacelib/COPYING`, and `ratman/LICENSE` before redistribution.
